	(gr_text "Here's to the crazy ones. The misfits. \nThe rebels. The troublemakers. \nThe round pegs in the square holes.\nThe ones who see things differently.\n-Steve Jobs\n\n\n\n\nThis took me like six whole hours lol. \nenjoy your macro-pad:)"
